### Slotwise API — example requests
### Works with the VS Code "REST Client" extension or JetBrains HTTP client.

@api = http://localhost:4000/api/v1
@dental = 5e000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000003

### Health
GET http://localhost:4000/health

### Public business info
GET {{api}}/businesses/lumen-clinic

### Sign up
POST {{api}}/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{ "fullName": "Sara Malik", "email": "sara@example.com", "password": "Passw0rd!" }

### Log in (copy "token" into @token below)
# @name login
POST {{api}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "demo@slotwise.dev", "password": "Demo@12345" }

###
@token = {{login.response.body.token}}

### Me
GET {{api}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Services
GET {{api}}/services
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Availability (use an upcoming Mon–Sat date)
GET {{api}}/appointments/availability?serviceId={{dental}}&date=2026-10-07
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Book with the form endpoint
POST {{api}}/appointments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "serviceId": "{{dental}}", "date": "2026-10-07", "time": "14:00", "notes": "First visit" }

### My upcoming appointments
GET {{api}}/appointments?scope=upcoming
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Start a conversation
# @name session
POST {{api}}/chat/sessions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
@sessionId = {{session.response.body.session.id}}

### Send a message
POST {{api}}/chat/sessions/{{sessionId}}/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "content": "I need a dental cleaning next Wednesday at 3pm" }

### Confirm the pending booking summary
POST {{api}}/chat/sessions/{{sessionId}}/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Conversation history
GET {{api}}/chat/sessions/{{sessionId}}/messages?limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
